scope nine-realms

ratify d-0001
ratify d-0002
ratify d-0003
ratify d-0004
ratify d-0005
ratify d-0006
ratify d-0007
ratify d-0008
ratify d-0009
ratify d-0010
ratify d-0011
ratify d-0012
ratify d-0013
ratify d-0014
era elder-age < the-binding-age < the-wolf-age < after-ragnarok decided d-0001
event the-world-shaped       during elder-age decided d-0002
event the-wall-raised        during elder-age decided d-0002
event the-binding-of-fenrir  during the-binding-age decided d-0003
event the-death-of-baldr     during the-binding-age decided d-0003
event fimbulwinter-falls     during the-wolf-age proposed
event the-last-battle        during the-wolf-age decided d-0004
before the-binding-of-fenrir -> the-death-of-baldr decided d-0003
narration vantage after-ragnarok
cycle season(4) = winter | spring | summer | autumn decided d-0009
cycle great-year(4) = gold | strife | doom | reborn decided d-0009
rule elder-age-held-back over order decided d-0010
  : listener-learns(during elder-age _) requires act > 1
place asgard       "Asgard"       decided d-0004
place vanaheim     "Vanaheim"     decided d-0004
place alfheim      "Alfheim"      decided d-0004
place midgard      "Midgard"      decided d-0005
place jotunheim    "Jotunheim"    decided d-0005
place svartalfheim "Svartalfheim" decided d-0005
place muspelheim   "Muspelheim"   decided d-0006
place niflheim     "Niflheim"     decided d-0006
place helheim      "Helheim"      decided d-0006
adjacent(asgard, midgard)       decided d-0004
adjacent(asgard, vanaheim)      decided d-0004
adjacent(midgard, jotunheim)    decided d-0005
adjacent(midgard, svartalfheim) decided d-0005
adjacent(vanaheim, alfheim)     decided d-0005
adjacent(muspelheim, niflheim)  decided d-0006
adjacent(niflheim, helheim)     decided d-0006
adjacent(jotunheim, niflheim)   decided d-0006
adjacent(asgard, alfheim)       proposed
person odin     "Odin All-Father" decided d-0006
person thor     "Thor"            decided d-0007
person loki     "Loki"            decided d-0007
person heimdall "Heimdall"        decided d-0007
thing gungnir "Gungnir"      decided d-0008
thing sol     "Sol, the Sun" decided d-0008
fact odin rules asgard       decided d-0006
fact thor guards midgard     decided d-0007
fact heimdall watches asgard decided d-0007
state sol.course = crossing until the-last-battle decided d-0008
state sol.course = devoured since the-last-battle decided d-0008
warded(asgard)  ratified d-0011
stormed(asgard) proposed
rule ward-holds ratified d-0011
  ward-holds($r) :- warded($r), not stormed($r)
term the-doom "Ragnarok, the fated fall of the gods and the burning of the Nine Realms" decided d-0012
banned gunpowder d-0013 "the Nine Realms keep to seax and spear — no black-powder anachronism"
banned clockwork d-0013 "fate is spun by the Norns, never geared — no mechanism in-world"
fork what-does-wisdom-cost
  option an-eye-at-the-well
  option a-nine-day-hanging
hypothesis h-return "the world rises again, green, out of the sea after the fire"
question who-holds-the-reborn-world "Who holds the world after the fire?"
  option the-sons-of-thor implies holds(the-sons-of-thor, after-ragnarok)
  option baldr-returned
holds(baldr, after-ragnarok) proposed assumes baldr-returned and h-return
hypothesis h-seer-foresaw "the seeress foresaw the doom from the first, and sang it before it came"
event the-first-prophecy  during the-binding-age proposed assumes h-seer-foresaw
ratify d-0014 {
  h-seer-foresaw := true
}
